    "This is Game Porting Toolkit, a different download from the same page. Download the one with the blue icon: Evaluation environment for Windows games.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das ist Game Porting Toolkit, ein anderer Download von derselben Seite. Lade den mit dem blauen Symbol: Evaluation environment for Windows games."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esto es Game Porting Toolkit, otra descarga de la misma página. Descarga la del icono azul: Evaluation environment for Windows games."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "C’est Game Porting Toolkit, un autre téléchargement de la même page. Téléchargez celui à l’icône bleue : Evaluation environment for Windows games."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Questo è Game Porting Toolkit, un altro download della stessa pagina. Scarica quello con l’icona blu: Evaluation environment for Windows games."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "これは同じページにある別のダウンロード、Game Porting Toolkit です。青いアイコンの Evaluation environment for Windows games をダウンロードしてください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이것은 같은 페이지의 다른 다운로드인 Game Porting Toolkit입니다. 파란색 아이콘의 Evaluation environment for Windows games를 다운로드하세요."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Это Game Porting Toolkit — другая загрузка с той же страницы. Скачайте ту, что с синей иконкой: Evaluation environment for Windows games."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是同一页面上的另一个下载 Game Porting Toolkit。请下载带蓝色图标的 Evaluation environment for Windows games。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
